  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<para>For questions 1 – 4, add the equations in the system to find a new equation.</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="d13bb4e1-a8fa-4443-a79b-71e6ca1a4311" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="2" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--Q1-->
  <exercise data-content-id="c03daac5-e19e-4214-9ed3-81dd1107a242" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\(–8y = –40\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\(2y = –38\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–2y = –40\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–8y = –40\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–8x = –40\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x - 5y = -1\\ -6x - 3y = -39 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(–8y = –40\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--Q2-->
  <exercise data-content-id="cc7025cc-a782-4eac-9737-77a337e29ca4" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\(–x = –7\) or \(x = 7\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\(x = –7\\) or \\(–x = 7\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–x = –7\\) or \\(x = 7\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–6x = –7\\) or \\(6x = 7\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–11x = –7\\) or \\(11x = 7\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 5x - 3y = -1\\ -6x + 3y = -6 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(–x = –7\) or \(x = 7\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--Q3-->
  <exercise data-content-id="564b8d2d-aef4-438a-b352-0ef8d4fb0497" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\(–13y = 65\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\(–13y = 65\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–8x = 65\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–8y = 65\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(–13x = 65\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 4x - 3y = 3\\ -4x - 10y = 62 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(–13y = 65\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--Q4-->
  <exercise data-content-id="0d47e68e-20c1-4143-aef1-de09980d6678" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\(6y = 0\\) or \\(y = 0\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(6x = 0\\) or \\(x = 0\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(12x = 0\\) or \\(x = 0\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(6y = 12\\) or \\(y = 6\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x + 16y = -6\\ -6x - 10y = 6 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2.</para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--Do not edit below line.-->
  <solution>
    <!-- INSERT ANY VALID HTML HERE -->
  </solution>
  <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
